<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Keep my lips (so quick to anger) full of grace to speak forth You,</l><l>Keep my ears firmly planted in my spirit to hear You,</l><l>By Your blood, cleanse me from my every sin,</l><l>By Your word, sanctify me more and more within.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Set my hands in constant labor on the land to bring forth You,</l><l>Set my feet swift and able going forth to bring good news,</l><l>On the cross, You have won the victory,</l><l>On the throne, You’re interceding every day for me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
